    {
      "target": "모래에 작은 발자국이 찍혔어요.",
      "reading": "morae-e jageun baljagugi jjikyeosseoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Small footprints were left in the sand.",
        "ko": "모래에 작은 발자국이 찍혔어요.",
        "ipa": "morae-e jageun baljagugi jjikyeosseoyo.",
